  "pack": "Owned 140g parallel 18650 pack unqualified. PRIMARY: protector PCB-Li-1S15A + F_PACK 0287015.U/FH_PACK 0FHA0002XP at pack positive; peak 10.6 A at 3.3 V; cells >=8 A each (2 cells). M_PACK_BREAKER and the 30 A/100 A fault qualification belong to the OPTIONAL TPS61287 chain only. See POWER_SYSTEM.md.",
  "fan": "Owned 30x30mm 5V fan; unknown MPN/current. Design allocation including startup <=0.30A, not claimed measured.",
  "sonar": "Owned order HC-SR04P x2. Reference 4tronix 3.0-5.5V variant; actual labels/thresholds must be checked.",
  "powerModuleMods": "PRIMARY converters are unmodified Pololu U3V70F5 x2 (one 4.7 k ENABLE-GND resistor on island B). TPS61287 modifications apply only to the optional reference chain.",
  "wiring": "14AWG pack pair <=0.4 m round trip to both converter inputs; each input <=7 A prolonged; outputs never joined; island B red wires via 5 A fuse; 18AWG downstream 5V on J_PWR unchanged. 12AWG/30 A terminal requirement applies only to the optional reference chain."
 },
